ahoe (26.6.2) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Metal (Mobile) - integrated Apple M4 Pro (Apple9) - Apple M4 Pro (14 threads) - 24.00 GiB memory - CoreAudio (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe TileSet editor states that you can \"Hold Ctrl to create multiple tiles\". However, on macOS, this behavior is linked to the Command (⌘) key; the Control (⌃) key instead pans the view when clicking and dragging, and provides the option to create a new tile at the cursor position if a tile is clicked when Control is held.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ba33f54d-9c14-4dc1-82fb-2cf113707e3d\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a TileMapLayer, and from there a TileSet. Open the TileSet editor dock and create a new Atlas Tile Source. A hint at the bottom says \"Hold Ctrl to create multiple tiles\".\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123264/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timel